	(text "Wired to the Pi Zero header. Bend Pi pins 13, 19,\n23, 35 and 37 away from the display board.\n1  Dial B  -> pin 19, GPIO 10\n2  GND     -> pin 6\n3  Dial A  -> pin 23, GPIO 11\n4  5V      -> pin 2\n5  A+      -> pin 35, GPIO 19 (PWM audio)\n6  SW2     -> pin 37, GPIO 26\n7  SW1     -> pin 13, GPIO 27"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 50.8 36.83 0)
		(effects
